  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.775,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It seems that the confession-book has vanished from existence.",
      "output_sha256": "649ab4ae17cfedd3d08873a03184263569f69f32287f7d6634a123de690ceb64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.363333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "97562b7f5c115e56004204ef53904e12dbc4c9a44589b04c8fecdf52bdcdfa14"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "649ab4ae17cfedd3d08873a03184263569f69f32287f7d6634a123de690ceb64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is twenty years since I have seen one.",
      "output_sha256": "7670771c9fd5a208c3eecf37ea455afd8084729bf96a3580443934556823bdab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "7670771c9fd5a208c3eecf37ea455afd8084729bf96a3580443934556823bdab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As a boy I told some inquisitive owner what was my favourite food (porridge, I fancy), my favourite hero in real life and in fiction, my favourite virtue in woman, and so forth.",
      "output_sha256": "c132b1c7419808d1df717ccb952c1c4851ecb2dbb3a1155152059b38f2f6eabd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "c132b1c7419808d1df717ccb952c1c4851ecb2dbb3a1155152059b38f2f6eabd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was a boy, and it didn't really matter what were my likes and dislikes then, for I was bound to outgrow them.",
      "output_sha256": "61e02ad13291ffc974473d2673ece35fea6e5262cf1ae62390a10882f194bb33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "61e02ad13291ffc974473d2673ece35fea6e5262cf1ae62390a10882f194bb33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But Heaven help the journalist of those days who had to sign his name to opinions so definite!",
      "output_sha256": "58b110fc9d7b39885cff8dadb71876e207fcaa080b85a734d8c10c51e265ca6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "58b110fc9d7b39885cff8dadb71876e207fcaa080b85a734d8c10c51e265ca6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For when a writer has said in print (as I am going to say directly) that the daffodil is his favourite flower, simply because, looking round his room for inspiration, he has seen a bowl of daffodils on his table and thought it beautiful, it would be hard on him if some confession- album-owner were to expose him in the following issue as already committed on oath to the violet.",
      "output_sha256": "f6df4ada05bb529638fc4e2735138529a36bc8b79f44cd3fbd4fa3ddc6a7088d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6df4ada05bb529638fc4e2735138529a36bc8b79f44cd3fbd4fa3ddc6a7088d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Imaginative art would become impossible.",
      "output_sha256": "3eed319f5829974ada3b88a959f6aec9a46e1abff8e017131220a01e66fa1fad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "3eed319f5829974ada3b88a959f6aec9a46e1abff8e017131220a01e66fa1fad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Luckily for me, I face no such constraints, and I can boldly state that the daffodil is, and has always been, my favorite flower.",
      "output_sha256": "f4caa3ee7f3896a0d5a4d93b50a96a523a639860151e2c57a0d6c185209fdba0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.503164,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "abbfde09def3f43dc5578cce6171f3003b15d9e379533c28855af4fec9b2e216"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f4caa3ee7f3896a0d5a4d93b50a96a523a639860151e2c57a0d6c185209fdba0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While many might argue in favor of the rose, I contend that the joy the daffodil brings is unparalleled, much like the pleasure a thousand pounds might provide to Rockefeller compared to the delight it offers to you or me.",
      "output_sha256": "63f25be4527b54175f2806048f884402fe54019f40739f73de6a67166a6009c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.428022,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7f2c5b0b65d6038e353fa59f66ac97bc0267b73d67e64dbb5bdf4fd1cda0d0f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "63f25be4527b54175f2806048f884402fe54019f40739f73de6a67166a6009c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the daffodil comes, not only before the swallow comes— which is a matter of indifference, as nobody thinks any the worse of the swallow in consequence—but before all the many flowers of summer; it comes on the heels of a flowerless winter.",
      "output_sha256": "88101b6660d2744bf2696924c64c20c266878d2a72169c8fa967b1141749a796",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "88101b6660d2744bf2696924c64c20c266878d2a72169c8fa967b1141749a796",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whereby it is as superior to the rose as an oasis in the Sahara is to champagne at a wedding.",
      "output_sha256": "881e23dcf8eaebcbb647e2cb0692ac681d8a88ee52cd32584431730e13a71b02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "881e23dcf8eaebcbb647e2cb0692ac681d8a88ee52cd32584431730e13a71b02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yes, a favourite flower must be a spring flower—there is no doubt about that.",
      "output_sha256": "e56de55f0292f17dcd6affe466a9bd8cbb5c2949f3471663032796d16686f9eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "e56de55f0292f17dcd6affe466a9bd8cbb5c2949f3471663032796d16686f9eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This leaves us with a selection of the daffodil, violet, primrose, and crocus.",
      "output_sha256": "fd692cc81b638c193605334bbd1995ed817032709bca4628b87836e536119729",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.531667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fc629abd7a9c014b10e8c4a3676aa7e5058ad5ec33e6b1760d19c9d7f0498575"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fd692cc81b638c193605334bbd1995ed817032709bca4628b87836e536119729",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The bluebell comes too late, the cowslip is but an indifferent primrose; camelias and anemones and all the others which occur to you come into a different class.",
      "output_sha256": "6009725f14a7fd00cfd26cad3f081e35befdba7dbd5df45bc73ea0ec2f0539b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "6009725f14a7fd00cfd26cad3f081e35befdba7dbd5df45bc73ea0ec2f0539b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "So, will you opt for the violet or the crocus?",
      "output_sha256": "7377bc609938718b940dcf5627b04f7fa86ae877e97f465603b55ea0bf940863",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.643571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f2fac27501aeb925c41c3449b20fff23ef0c536d1b8587217122dec8a6a8975e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7377bc609938718b940dcf5627b04f7fa86ae877e97f465603b55ea0bf940863",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Or will you follow the legendary Disraeli and have primroses on your statue?",
      "output_sha256": "e9d30732549f798a265f20e1d0db8277bbfe871d8510f870e769263a9258fa6e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "e9d30732549f798a265f20e1d0db8277bbfe871d8510f870e769263a9258fa6e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I write as one who spends most of his life in London, and for me the violet, the primrose, and the crocus are lacking in the same necessary quality—they pick badly.",
      "output_sha256": "bb4aad32ad8f57358cf39a708b0841ac3762db6216f4adceb18e60a0cc6d5c4d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb4aad32ad8f57358cf39a708b0841ac3762db6216f4adceb18e60a0cc6d5c4d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My choice of a favorite flower must include the ability to enhance my home; it needs to showcase its beauty effectively indoors, which necessitates a long stalk.",
      "output_sha256": "4d4403edfe59424248db183187f80cbe5a0313a209538109023ade1f4b6324b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.410524,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "27fd6964039aeb9f3267abc67a0284a67773a14b0cf2ce1c5362922c1e010139"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4d4403edfe59424248db183187f80cbe5a0313a209538109023ade1f4b6324b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A crocus, least of all, is a flower to be plucked.",
      "output_sha256": "a4cde8d8c9176038554482fec73fdcaac2b56e96916a4a6d2dfde62b647b4829",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4cde8d8c9176038554482fec73fdcaac2b56e96916a4a6d2dfde62b647b4829",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I admit its charm as the first hint of spring that is vouchsafed to us in the parks, but I want it nearer home than that.",
      "output_sha256": "336a1e450fcc0c45cd963fd9dac0707cdc070edfa8cd01f23e480e885987d1b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "336a1e450fcc0c45cd963fd9dac0707cdc070edfa8cd01f23e480e885987d1b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is impossible to pluck a crocus and place it in water; it would be cruel to remove the primrose and violet from their natural habitat.",
      "output_sha256": "e3221df3a016514612766313cad89e5bd453d0a5474fa1dbcc777255858251ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.49432,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62e083f0552110681506d84c19a212e3309d3716a11adfed6f0912b41d815d79"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e3221df3a016514612766313cad89e5bd453d0a5474fa1dbcc777255858251ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In contrast, the daffodil eagerly invites being picked.",
      "output_sha256": "c0afdc84c8dba0fed917dd0c54c882377b42b98114fbce3c05afc7f4c010e296",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.49432,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62e083f0552110681506d84c19a212e3309d3716a11adfed6f0912b41d815d79"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c0afdc84c8dba0fed917dd0c54c882377b42b98114fbce3c05afc7f4c010e296",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is what it is waiting for.",
      "output_sha256": "53713b3150d3177809259fbcc42215f51d55d726ad5030b1fb944cca517ef18a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "53713b3150d3177809259fbcc42215f51d55d726ad5030b1fb944cca517ef18a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Long stalks, please.\"",
      "output_sha256": "5406a80252d228a0d45d0b87846ee12d3293fefcf634c0f80eafa5be9e322bfb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "5406a80252d228a0d45d0b87846ee12d3293fefcf634c0f80eafa5be9e322bfb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Who, being commanded by his lady to bring in flowers for the house, has not received this warning?",
      "output_sha256": "375aa0fc6813d764d62f13a53d77c712e4250e905f6a9bae7412acb8d7a1cc85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "375aa0fc6813d764d62f13a53d77c712e4250e905f6a9bae7412acb8d7a1cc85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And was there ever a stalk to equal the daffodil's for length and firmness and beauty?",
      "output_sha256": "0c57df7ec31878ecba65979c91c49c774d8cc2bcef4d608686638a5361635b3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c57df7ec31878ecba65979c91c49c774d8cc2bcef4d608686638a5361635b3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Other flowers require foliage to enhance their appearance, but daffodils can stand alone in a vase, their green and yellow attire bringing the essence of spring into any room.",
      "output_sha256": "396fdcd256e5e547b6dd17e96133dacc59ace40b23f7a4b1eb8cd41ad895a12b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.620513,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f4d9096bdd7615d980133ac5c94f682df20aaf4cdfd503cb162a96ab655adb7f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "396fdcd256e5e547b6dd17e96133dacc59ace40b23f7a4b1eb8cd41ad895a12b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A house with daffodils in it is a house lit up, whether or no the sun be shining outside.",
      "output_sha256": "f01cd18de064a38a21c0927267c2b64b6fd2eea082c55cc6c4d38413e3718c93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "f01cd18de064a38a21c0927267c2b64b6fd2eea082c55cc6c4d38413e3718c93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Daffodils in a green bowl—let the snow fall, if it must.",
      "output_sha256": "f85e2a3b73d439b5d70e389922e96e1a5288e86ecdc082849151f8ca9c018467",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.775,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9517d832d8ae0f37114813e5de85f9a78ab12901eb8f5f423213b18542415f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f85e2a3b73d439b5d70e389922e96e1a5288e86ecdc082849151f8ca9c018467",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Wordsworth wrote a poem about daffodils.",
      "output_sha256": "cc2fc1d7c027f39411330d5ae0a21aaec87fce8f865b5e8c86c0ecf091ea4d07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "cc2fc1d7c027f39411330d5ae0a21aaec87fce8f865b5e8c86c0ecf091ea4d07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In fact, he wrote verses about most flowers.",
      "output_sha256": "16bbebee392e40c477aeb8f42c877f4ddfd1174a6ad9b6cabe0ef331104a3c6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.642857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1cb80784714b5a256819df9a4c6267747bee24af209480b3b400fcc3179e146"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16bbebee392e40c477aeb8f42c877f4ddfd1174a6ad9b6cabe0ef331104a3c6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If a plant would be unique it must be one which had never inspired him to song.",
      "output_sha256": "4ef1686b4955844b8c6fac7150621fc0605af67422c25e8b14e1e465b0dbc20e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ef1686b4955844b8c6fac7150621fc0605af67422c25e8b14e1e465b0dbc20e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But he did not write about daffodils in a bowl.",
      "output_sha256": "45de7b87cb2c488336f6ae8ff4064175d3efde4dccb64100936f0a58452310e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "45de7b87cb2c488336f6ae8ff4064175d3efde4dccb64100936f0a58452310e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The daffodils which I celebrate are stationary; Wordsworth's lived on the banks of Ullswater, and fluttered and tossed their heads and danced in the breeze.",
      "output_sha256": "2fef47000aa24c8fc3dd31b8d9fbdd5c9582c2b61a7622b8bf38432d550ef37e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fef47000aa24c8fc3dd31b8d9fbdd5c9582c2b61a7622b8bf38432d550ef37e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He hints that in their company even he might have been jocose—a terrifying thought, which makes me happier to have mine safely indoors.",
      "output_sha256": "883c59e45635090880cb7ed37fb724abca43920878ea9d40da85b23af8e7874a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "883c59e45635090880cb7ed37fb724abca43920878ea9d40da85b23af8e7874a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When he first encountered them, he gazed with wonder, unaware of the wealth that such a sight would bestow upon him.",
      "output_sha256": "63f4624d92da587526c80c5aad3ed78104f25bf78ed93cff5660444eb61e8130",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.46,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de4e5d97eabf94b8de405d72be0cb43d4727c787e84587fdbae98818b34ec6a7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "63f4624d92da587526c80c5aad3ed78104f25bf78ed93cff5660444eb61e8130",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Strictly speaking, it hadn't brought him in anything at the moment, but he must have known from his previous experiences with the daisy and the celandine that it was good for a certain amount.",
      "output_sha256": "1401b67536d05df239d531cc648430f9c05691e3f39143d623526118e91b8490",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "1401b67536d05df239d531cc648430f9c05691e3f39143d623526118e91b8490",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A simple daffodil to him Was so much matter for a slim Volume at two and four.",
      "output_sha256": "f11adcefa1952186658079c387c625240e4c72f281c56e6f48ee0972449aad46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "f11adcefa1952186658079c387c625240e4c72f281c56e6f48ee0972449aad46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "You might argue that I am in no better position, but unlike him, I have never criticized others for merely perceiving a primrose as just a primrose.",
      "output_sha256": "34dfb40e6a813569070d37a23380006071e0838d886c0cc6ba3f0be1886b0c2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.550072,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d94535f6253fd410d684fa8f11001af719ad241bc9ab3c399c221ef0130f6e96"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "34dfb40e6a813569070d37a23380006071e0838d886c0cc6ba3f0be1886b0c2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Regardless of whether you prefer them as I do—indoors—or as Wordsworth did—outdoors—the name of the flower merits attention.",
      "output_sha256": "458299585a265ef27eebcc2427e0f7d58c8254257d2052fd89925083f4542476",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.378084,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "31f688ba960def2d227cbdfdd80f8347ca45538918841d7c8a19dcd7cebe8f32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "458299585a265ef27eebcc2427e0f7d58c8254257d2052fd89925083f4542476",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Is there a more beautiful name in existence than daffodil?",
      "output_sha256": "aa148f16395e2fceeffef9fda2e99e8122843437126937146b5973cd83e6a604",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.681439,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "77203c9a226184c3e64e60887de3bd8f6974a27eb78a5967bc1ceb4308dfdc0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa148f16395e2fceeffef9fda2e99e8122843437126937146b5973cd83e6a604",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Say it over to yourself, and then say \"agapanthus\" or \"chrysanthemum,\" or anything else you please, and tell me if the daffodils do not have it.",
      "output_sha256": "ee26e540d2c5589dd97b2c6c9d86ca2bf263c721eb0ea272ffe32c818b107994",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee26e540d2c5589dd97b2c6c9d86ca2bf263c721eb0ea272ffe32c818b107994",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Pansies, lilies, kingcups, daisies, Let them live upon their praises; Long as there's a sun that sets, Primroses will have their glory; Long as there are violets They will have a place in story; But for flowers my bowls to fill, Give me just the daffodil.",
      "output_sha256": "4a11e00719f7f5b22b8a1aabc06bab4a4836e49e9efe0b80f252c445374451ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a11e00719f7f5b22b8a1aabc06bab4a4836e49e9efe0b80f252c445374451ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As Wordsworth ought to have said.",
      "output_sha256": "f814e293c12c4bc5f15157dde012ed3c3d9cc7f387edb48e53a6404acc51f202",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "f814e293c12c4bc5f15157dde012ed3c3d9cc7f387edb48e53a6404acc51f202",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
